{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "3788dbd7-2806-8815-8efc-cf24beb0f446",
  "created_at": "2026-03-04T11:52:36-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Yesenia Pagan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Anita Chaudhry",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:50:12-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Anita. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:50:17-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello? Yes, hello, I'm sorry, I'm hard of hearing, so I talk loud. Can you hear me all right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:50:25-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear you fine. Go ahead, I'll speak up a little too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:50:31-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good, good. My name is Yesenia Pagan. I live at 463 Van Zandt Avenue, in the North End. I want to rent out my house for two months this winter. Do I need a short-term rental license for that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:50:46-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. A couple of questions first. Is this your own home, and would the guests be staying the whole two months, or would it be several different stays?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:50:57-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "What was that? Several what?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:51:00-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Would it be one guest for two months, or different people coming and going?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:51:06-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, one party. One family, the whole two months. I own the house, yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:51:12-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Generally, renting a home for a short stretch can fall under the short-term rental license, and the length of the stay can matter. I'd want our licensing staff to confirm for a two-month single tenant. Can I take your number and have them call you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:51:29-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it's 401-555-0154."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:51:31-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0154. Now, is there anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:51:35-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. If I need the license, does a licensed contractor have to apply for it? Or can I apply myself? I'm the owner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:51:44-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Usually the owner applies. A contractor is only needed for construction work, not for a rental license."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:51:51-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Because I'm fixing a squeaky hinge on the front door before they come. Just the hinge. Do I need anybody for that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:52:00-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, a hinge is routine maintenance. You don't need a permit or a contractor for that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:52:07-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good, good. I was going to oil it myself. What was that about the staff? When will they call?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:52:15-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Someone from licensing will call you back, probably by tomorrow or the day after. They'll ask about the stay and tell you if you need the license."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:52:26-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Tomorrow or after. Okay. Thank you very much."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:52:30-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Ms. Pagan. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T11:52:34-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
